        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Electricity mix, low voltage, GO cancellations</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Electricity mix, low voltage, GO cancellations
This dataset describes the transformation from medium to low voltage as well as the distribution of electricity at low voltage.\nTime period: Time of publications.\nVersion: 1\nEnergy values: Undefined\nLocal category: Elektrizität\nLocal subcategory: Erzeugungsmix\nUVEK 2022 source file:726-Strommixe-EU_v0.8._X-GO cancellations Distribution.xml\n\n
UUID: 8b79f0d9-017c-3695-813a-386941b52718
Included are the electricity production in LV, the transmission network as well as direct SF6-emissions to air. Electricity losses during low-voltage transmission and transformation from medium-voltage are accounted for.
Location: undefined
Technology: undefined
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_8b79f0d9-017c-3695-813a-386941b52718.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
